{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0f41c5ecb61e958a1cbd8e5e8ae5114c0008159f5bdad0e8e006991c3ade8d1d", "ja": "（今日は新曲のPVを撮影している。休憩に入った\n志保は、スマホを見て、楽しそうにしている……）", "zh": "（今天正在拍摄新曲的PV。进入休息时间的志保，看着手机，显得很开心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "3ecf647c95b2de1148356be9b57b54b9ae546c934ab155ca8469d2e49c1f9100", "ja": "あ……。\nどうかしましたか、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "啊……。\n怎么了吗，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cad17ae00c113044dcd291f95b4a4881d471b9d95bdb6be2658cc0ccdc3e2ce3", "ja": "いや、ただ、楽しそうにしてるなぁって思って。", "zh": "不是，只是觉得你看起来挺开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "9510f7b9e61ddd0dc765ff1648f379a2e33461362f87d760727c2bf6a3564d11", "ja": "そうですか？　友達から来たメッセージを、\n見てただけなんですけど。", "zh": "这样啊？我只是看了朋友发来的消息而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "22c9e8cee26988f354e4b5363e1f6fe443685e3212adf4dffa02fbbf93ea7f29", "ja": "「お仕事頑張ってね」って。\n休み時間に送ってくれたみたいです。", "zh": "“要加油工作哦”，好像是她趁休息时间发给我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6690a928b127af1602d62e4ef7347e2f04a7ed725db879098deff3354cefed34", "ja": "へえ。学校の友達か。\n仲が良いんだな。", "zh": "哦，是学校里的朋友啊。关系很好嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "56bca7b598804612c4ef8fc97799cf5553ebad7eca9ccc7fae105f42091096a0", "ja": "そうですね。休み時間に話をしたり、\nお昼を一緒に食べたりしてます。", "zh": "是啊。我们会在休息时间聊天，\n也会一起吃午饭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "b61a5622e40b2bbc0fe312d1813dfc6067f2b1e20b48d4a21eed4c2be6038e8b", "ja": "でも、珍しいな。\nいつもはメッセージなんて送ってこないのに……。", "zh": "不过，还真少见。\n平时明明从来不会发消息过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e2da334e75ea5e9008c0c2524f65a5fe6251b0a9a1028d6639a62f37ba939a39", "ja": "そうなのか？\nなら、何かきっかけがあったのかもな。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n那说不定是发生了什么契机吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "abe1f585cc2aa79b84a871a2b45876d0f1258df6016405f49892f250f72a61bd", "ja": "きっかけ……あっ。", "zh": "契机……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "7b4054f64caae2d4573f770eb64626743d703202aaa32c8bb8ab737043dd3569", "ja": "そういえば、私が歌っているところを、\n初めて見たって言ってました。", "zh": "说起来，您还说过，那是第一次看到我唱歌的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "0de309350a496d082868b815ff6f830fe9430d1d674c3a99f2660a630c807798", "ja": "ふたりとも、すごく褒めてくれて。\nあんまり褒められるので、すこし恥ずかしかったです。", "zh": "两个人都特别夸我。\n因为一直被夸，感觉有点不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7fa03f3c8249185471dbe498b52c11edad966ebfb891fba2ff29400a77f11f16", "ja": "そうか。よかったな。", "zh": "这样啊。那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "f951da9d698ba7f78ea933d218ee8767e91312b634de1aa63dcbaca4d87c9a7f", "ja": "はい。……{$P$}さん。\nアイドルって、すごいんですね。", "zh": "是的。……{$P$}先生。偶像，真是了不起呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "70061d744576ab81e9089dc446954b5789208320a52cde3be645507cb578597a", "ja": "わかっていたつもりでしたけど……\n身近な人の言葉を聞くと、より実感します。", "zh": "我本以为自己明白……\n但听到身边人的话后，才有了更深的感受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1015_p", "source_sha256": "df5d072c87b9b30ff0ed48286d2dcc30f010d488478a575675c25776b0121581", "ja": "ああ。アイドルは、本当にすごい……。\nだからアイドルである志保も、すごいってことだな！", "zh": "啊。偶像真的很了不起……  \n所以，身为偶像的志保也很了不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "7af7e8d35d1ec2fb5be75c257a35fc10dbdb789e7d950f5130ab3278bc1fd141", "ja": "！！　そ、それは……。", "zh": "！！那、那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "8a6f5d5bcbb0595bb676257bc752f331b9b1b3657788955449b80be3ce777d71", "ja": "もちろん、そう思われるようにとは思ってますけど……\n私は、まだまだですから。", "zh": "当然，我也希望能让人这么想……可是，我还差得远呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "dd08fc5b7ec2802d85793694f27418378107d30c28731b8c0977bdb9f4145962", "ja": "素敵な曲をもらったんだから。この曲も、\n気に入ってもらえるように……がんばらないと。", "zh": "既然给了我这么棒的歌曲。为了让大家也喜欢上这首歌……我得努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0684_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0684_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "d08199c9e21966b5eb891c73769c97ae2d25a226c95bad1713235fa3d35bde15", "ja": "あ……そろそろ、撮影再開みたいですね。\n行ってきます、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "啊……好像差不多要重新开始拍摄了。\n我先过去了，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
